(271, 1, '2023-08-10 17:49:54', '2023-08-10 17:49:54', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.15.0 - 09-08-2023 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"1056\" height=\"1076\" src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/team-8.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/css/widget-icon-box.min.css\">		\n				<a href=\"http://tel;12345678900\">\n								</a>\n				<h5>\n					<a href=\"http://tel;12345678900\" >\n						 Tel : +123-4561-5523					</a>\n				</h5>\n				<a href=\"mailto:example@email.com\">\n								</a>\n				<h5>\n					<a href=\"mailto:example@email.com\" >\n						 Email : example@email.com					</a>\n				</h5>\n				<a href=\"https://google.com\">\n								</a>\n				<h5>\n					<a href=\"https://google.com\" >\n						 Map : Flat 20, Reynolds Neck					</a>\n				</h5>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.15.0 - 09-08-2023 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style>Support Engineer		\n			<h2> Trudie Styler </h2>		\n		Most gardens consist of a mix of natural and constructed elements, although even very \'natural\' gardens are always an inherently artificial creation. Natural 