		<img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/about-2.jpg\" alt=\"No alt text\" />					\n						<img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/about-1.jpg\" alt=\"No alt text\" />					\n					About Us				\n					<h2>Agrawal Goyanka & Co</h2>				\n					<p>\"Agrawal Goyanka & Co. is a trusted Chartered Accountancy firm offering expert services in auditing, taxation, financial consulting, and business advisory. We provide tailored solutions to individuals and businesses, ensuring compliance, strategic growth, and financial stability with a focus on integrity, professionalism, and long-term client relationships.\"</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"51\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/call.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3><b>Call us 24/7. </b> We can answer for all your questions.b</h3><p><a href=\"tel:10533368956\">105 333 689 56</a> or <a href=\"tel:(098)09809801\">(098) 098 09801</a></p>				\n					<a href=\"/about\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									Discover More \n					</a>\n					<h2>Services</h2>				\n					<h2>What We Offer for You</h2>				\n		<h5>What we bring to you</a></h5>		\n                                                    <img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/services-7.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Audit &amp; Assurance\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Audit &amp; Assurance                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We provide the assurance services in compliance with the ethical and professional standards.                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"/service/corporate-finance\">Services Details</a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/services-8.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Taxation\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Taxation                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We offer services in relation to tax planning, assessment handling and tax compliances.                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"/service/advance-analytics\">Services Details</a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/services-9.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Digital Automation and Transformation\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Digital Automation and Transformation                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We assist our clients in transforming their human-led-computerised processes into automated one                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"/service/digital-strategy\">Services Details</a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/cropped-CA-Arun-Agarwal-1.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Forensic and Investigation Services\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Forensic and Investigation Services                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We have a dedicated team of FAFD qualified professionals                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"\"></a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/cropped-CA-Arun-Agarwal-1.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Startup Advisory\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Startup Advisory                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We are eager to contribute to the start-up India campaign by assisting young entrepreneurs in completing legal and regulatory compliances.                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"\"></a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/cropped-CA-Arun-Agarwal-1.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Accounting &amp; Business Support\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Accounting &amp; Business Support                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We are helping our clients to outsource their finance department to us. Availing professional guidance at administrative level                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"\"></a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/cropped-CA-Arun-Agarwal-1.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"International Tax &amp; Cross border Taxation\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        International Tax &amp; Cross border Taxation                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We assist businesses to complete their international transactions without any hustle and complexities.\nRead More                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"\"></a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/cropped-CA-Arun-Agarwal-1.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Setting up &amp; Registration\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Setting up &amp; Registration                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        Our team comprises of company secretaries to assist new companies in completing their registration and filing compliances.                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"\"></a>\n					Deposit				\n					<h2>Calculate Plan</h2>				\n		[hf_form slug=\"home-form\"]		\n															<img width=\"570\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/plan.jpg\" alt=\"\" />															\n					Portfolio				\n					<h2>Case Studies</h2>				\n					<a href=\"/project\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									 View All Cases\n					</a>\n                    <!-- Portfolio Two Area Start -->\n                                            <img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/portfolio-6.jpg\"\n                                                alt=\"Paolo website design\">\n                                                <h4><a href=\"/portfolio/paolo-website-design\">Paolo website design</a></h4>\n                                                <p>\n                                                    Consultancy                                                </p>\n                                            <img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/portfolio-7.jpg\"\n                                                alt=\"Mikado consultancy\">\n                                                <h4><a href=\"/portfolio/mikado-consultancy\">Mikado consultancy</a></h4>\n                                                <p>\n                                                    Business                                                </p>\n                                            <img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/portfolio-8.jpg\"\n                                                alt=\"Pao finance solution\">\n                                                <h4><a href=\"/portfolio/pao-finance-solution\">Pao finance solution</a></h4>\n                                                <p>\n                                                    Digital Strategy                                                </p>\n                                            <img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/portfolio-5.jpg\"\n                                                alt=\"Make better decisions\">\n                                                <h4><a href=\"/portfolio/make-better-decisions\">Make better decisions</a></h4>\n                                                <p>\n                                                    Finance                                                </p>\n            <!-- Portfolio Two Area End -->\n                <a href=\"http://google.com\"><i\n                       ></i></a>\n					Experts				\n					<h2>Our House Of Avengers</h2>				\n                    <img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/team-1.jpg\" alt=\"No alt text\" />					\n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <li><a href=\"https://facebook.com\"><i\n                                       ></i></a></li>\n                                                                            <li><a href=\"https://twitter.com\"><i\n                                       ></i></a></li>\n                                                                            <li><a href=\"https://linkedin.com\"><i\n                                       ></i></a></li>\n                                                                    </ul>\n							<a href=\"#\"> </a>\n					<p>Founder</p>\n					                        <h4><a href=\"/david-bowie\">David Bowie</a></h4>\n                    <img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/team-2.jpg\" alt=\"No alt text\" />					\n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <li><a href=\"https://facebook.com\"><i\n                                       ></i></a></li>\n                                                                            <li><a href=\"https://twitter.com\"><i\n                                       ></i></a></li>\n                                                                            <li><a href=\"https://linkedin.com\"><i\n                                       ></i></a></li>\n                                                                    </ul>\n							<a href=\"#\"> </a>\n					<p>CEO</p>\n					                        <h4><a href=\"/duncan-jones\">Duncan Jones</a></h4>\n                    <img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/team-3.jpg\" alt=\"No alt text\" />					\n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <li><a href=\"https://facebook.com\"><i\n                                       ></i></a></li>\n                                                                            <li><a href=\"https://twitter.com\"><i\n                                       ></i></a></li>\n                                                                            <li><a href=\"https://linkedin.com\"><i\n                                       ></i></a></li>\n                                                                    </ul>\n							<a href=\"#\"> </a>\n					<p>Head Of Idea</p>\n					                        <h4><a href=\"/john-lennon\">John Lennon</a></h4>\n                    <img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/team-4.jpg\" alt=\"No alt text\" />					\n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <li><a href=\"https://facebook.com\"><i\n                                       ></i></a></li>\n                                                                            <li><a href=\"https://twitter.com\"><i\n                                       ></i></a></li>\n                                                                            <li><a href=\"https://linkedin.com\"><i\n                                       ></i></a></li>\n                                                                    </ul>\n							<a href=\"#\"> </a>\n					<p>Designer</p>\n					                        <h4><a href=\"/elton-john\">Elton John</a></h4>\n								<figure><img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/brand-3.png\" alt=\"brand-3\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/brand-1.png\" alt=\"brand-1\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/brand-5.png\" alt=\"brand-5\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/brand-4.png\" alt=\"brand-4\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/brand-2.png\" alt=\"brand-2\" /></figure>			\n					<h3>You can make an request to join our team</h3>				\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"/get-an-appointment\">\n											Get An Appointment\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/contact\">\n											Apply For Job\n											</a>\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n                    <img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/faq-3.jpg\" alt=\"No alt text\" />                    \n                        <img src=\"https://finaxio.themeori.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/faq-4.jpg\" alt=\"No alt text\" />                    \n					Faq				\n					<h2>Some Questions & A.</h2>				\n                    <h6 data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n                        data-bs-target=\"#collapse001\">Who can open a business bank account?</h6>\n                        <p>\n                            Any legally registered business entity, such as a sole proprietorship, partnership, limited liability company (LLC), corporation, or nonprofit, can open a business bank account.                        </p>\n                    <h6 data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n                        data-bs-target=\"#collapse101\">Why do I need a business bank account?</h6>\n                        <p>\n                            Separating your personal and business finances is crucial for legal, financial, and organisational reasons. It simplifies accounting, tax reporting, and financial analysis.                        </p>\n                    <h6 data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n                        data-bs-target=\"#collapse201\">Can I open a business account online?</h6>\n                        <p>\n                            Many banks offer online account opening, especially for simpler business structures. However, in-person visits might be necessary for certain businesses or additional verification.                        </p>\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 384 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M202.021 0C122.202 0 70.503 32.703 29.914 91.026c-7.363 10.58-5.093 25.086 5.178 32.874l43.138 32.709c10.373 7.865 25.132 6.026 33.253-4.148 25.049-31.381 43.63-49.449 82.757-49.449 30.764 0 68.816 19.799 68.816 49.631 0 22.552-18.617 34.134-48.993 51.164-35.423 19.86-82.299 44.576-82.299 106.405V320c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h72.471c13.255 0 24-10.745 24-24v-5.773c0-42.86 125.268-44.645 125.268-160.627C377.504 66.256 286.902 0 202.021 0zM192 373.459c-38.196 0-69.271 31.075-69.271 69.271 0 38.195 31.075 69.27 69.271 69.27s69.271-31.075 69.271-69.271-31.075-69.27-69.271-69.27z\"></path></svg>			\n		<p>If you have more questions <a style=\"color: #ec1113;\" href=\"/contact\">Contact Us</a></p>', 'Home One - Light', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '12-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-26 07:08:20', '2025-03-26 07:08:20', '', 12, 'https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/?p=1656', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
