 We can answer for all your questions.</h3><p><a href=\"tel:+91 9414032355\">+91 9414032355</a> </p>				\n					<a href=\"/about\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									Discover More \n					</a>\n					<h2>Services</h2>				\n                                                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/CA-Arun-Agarwal-1.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Audit &amp; Assurance\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Audit &amp; Assurance                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We provide the assurance services in compliance with the ethical and professional standards.                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"#\">Services Details</a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/CA-Arun-Agarwal-1.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Taxation\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Taxation                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We offer services in relation to tax planning, assessment handling and tax compliances.                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"#\">Services Details</a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/CA-Arun-Agarwal-1.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Digital Automation and Transformation\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Digital Automation and Transformation                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We assist our clients in transforming their human-led-computerised processes into automated one                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"#\">Services Details</a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/cropped-CA-Arun-Agarwal-1.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Forensic and Investigation Services\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Forensic and Investigation Services                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We have a dedicated team of FAFD qualified professionals                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"\"></a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/cropped-CA-Arun-Agarwal-1.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Startup Advisory\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Startup Advisory                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We are eager to contribute to the start-up India campaign by assisting young entrepreneurs in completing legal and regulatory compliances.                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"\"></a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/cropped-CA-Arun-Agarwal-1.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Accounting &amp; Business Support\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Accounting &amp; Business Support                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We are helping our clients to outsource their finance department to us. Availing professional guidance at administrative level                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"\"></a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/cropped-CA-Arun-Agarwal-1.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"International Tax &amp; Cross border Taxation\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        International Tax &amp; Cross border Taxation                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        We assist businesses to complete their international transactions without any hustle and complexities.\nRead More                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"\"></a>\n                                                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/cropped-CA-Arun-Agarwal-1.png\"\n                                                        alt=\"Setting up &amp; Registration\">\n                                                    <h4>\n                                                        Setting up &amp; Registration                                                    </h4>\n                                                    <p>\n                                                        Our team comprises of company secretaries to assist new companies in completing their registration and filing compliances.                                                    </p>\n                                            <a href=\"\"></a>\n					Experts				\n					<h2>Our Team</h2>				\n                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dummy-image-1.jpg\" alt=\"No alt text\" />					\n					<p>Founder</p>\n					                        <h4><a href=\"/david-bowie\">CA Arun Agarwal</a></h4>\n                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dummy-image-1.jpg\" alt=\"No alt text\" />					\n					<p>Manager</p>\n					                        <h4><a href=\"/duncan-jones\">CA Deepak </a></h4>\n                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dummy-image-1.jpg\" alt=\"No alt text\" />					\n					<p>Head Of Idea</p>\n					                        <h4><a href=\"/john-lennon\">CA Ankit</a></h4>\n                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dummy-image-1.jpg\" alt=\"No alt text\" />					\n					<p>HR</p>\n					                        <h4><a href=\"/elton-john\">CA Komal</a></h4>\n					<h3>You can make an request to join our team</h3>				\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"/get-an-appointment\">\n											Get An Appointment\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/contact\">\n											Apply For Job\n											</a>\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n                    <img src=\"https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/3.jpg\" alt=\"No alt text\" />                    \n					Faq				\n					<h2>Some Questions & A.</h2>				\n                    <h6 data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n                        data-bs-target=\"#collapse001\">Do I need a CA to file my ITR?</h6>\n                        <p>\n                            Any legally registered business entity, such as a sole proprietorship, partnership, limited liability company (LLC), corporation, or nonprofit, can open a business bank account.                        </p>\n                    <h6 data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n                        data-bs-target=\"#collapse101\">How much does a chartered accountant charge for tax filing?</h6>\n                        <p>\n                            Separating your personal and business finances is crucial for legal, financial, and organisational reasons. It simplifies accounting, tax reporting, and financial analysis.                        </p>\n                    <h6 data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n                        data-bs-target=\"#collapse201\">Can CA help to save taxes?</h6>\n                        <p>\n                            Many banks offer online account opening, especially for simpler business structures. However, in-person visits might be necessary for certain businesses or additional verification.                        </p>\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 384 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M202.021 0C122.202 0 70.503 32.703 29.914 91.026c-7.363 10.58-5.093 25.086 5.178 32.874l43.138 32.709c10.373 7.865 25.132 6.026 33.253-4.148 25.049-31.381 43.63-49.449 82.757-49.449 30.764 0 68.816 19.799 68.816 49.631 0 22.552-18.617 34.134-48.993 51.164-35.423 19.86-82.299 44.576-82.299 106.405V320c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h72.471c13.255 0 24-10.745 24-24v-5.773c0-42.86 125.268-44.645 125.268-160.627C377.504 66.256 286.902 0 202.021 0zM192 373.459c-38.196 0-69.271 31.075-69.271 69.271 0 38.195 31.075 69.27 69.271 69.27s69.271-31.075 69.271-69.271-31.075-69.27-69.271-69.27z\"></path></svg>			\n		If you have more questions <a style=\"color: #7EB84E;\" href=\"/contact\">Contact Us</a>', 'Home One - Light', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '12-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-18 10:07:33', '2025-04-18 10:07:33', '', 12, 'https://agrawalgoyanka.co.in/?p=1800', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
